00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:23.100
Einen warmen Tomat-

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:23.700
Toma-

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.400
Tomatensalat

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:28.200
