00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:29.400
Olivenöl,

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:32.000
Knoblauch natürlich,

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:33.500
Senfkörnern,

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:34.300
Pfeffer.

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:35.300
Eine Zitrone.

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:36.400
Da unbedingt darauf achten,

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:39.600
